{
  "esm": "1.0.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "moves.evaporative",
    "description": "Template library: the two shapes the EVAPORATIVE chain adds, from docs/evap-leaks.md \u00a74.2 and \u00a74.3. Both are small, and both are here rather than inline because the arithmetic either side of them looks alike and the difference is load-bearing.\n\n`operating_share_of_activity` is E1, crates/moves-calculators/src/generators/evap_op_mode_distribution.rs:350 -- `least(1, SUM(SHO) / SUM(sourceHours))`, with the zero-denominator guard that `COALESCE(SUM(SHO), 0)`'s other half implies. It is NOT lib/onroad_activity.esm's `share_of_group`, and merging the two would be wrong in both directions: `share_of_group` has no cap, and a cap on a normalisation would silently change the travel fraction of docs/mixed-onroad.md S3.\n\n`soak_share` is E2, :443 stage 2 -- `soakActivityFraction * (1 - fractionOfOperating)`. One product, two parameters, and a name. The name is the point. E3's operating-mode-300 fraction is `greatest(0, 1 - SUM(soak shares))`, a RESIDUAL over a different set, and the two subtractions are easy to confuse: on the process-evap-leaks fixture `fractionOfOperating` is exactly 1, so `opModeFraction[300] = fractionOfOperating` and `opModeFraction[300] = 1 - SUM(...)` agree to the last bit and only one of them is right (docs/evap-leaks.md \u00a72.3 measures the difference on a probe as 6.8e-08). Naming the soak half makes the residual half conspicuous by NOT having a template.\n\nDeliberately absent: a `clamp01`. There are two clamps in this stage, `least(1, .)` at E1 and `greatest(0, .)` at E3, with different bodies and different constants, and in both cases the VALUE the clamp takes is the load-bearing fact. A shared template would hide which clamp is which -- the same reasoning lib/onroad_activity.esm records for declining to factor the two onroad clamps. Also absent: the `/ noOfRealDays` of L9. It appears once, and it is the third thing in this port that carries a 7-day week and combines it differently from the other two (lib/conversion.esm's `temporal_scale` and lib/onroad_activity.esm's `weeks_per_month`); three templates for three combinations, none merged.\n\nAs with every library here, an `enums` block is file-local and does not cross a template import (esm-spec \u00a79.3, finding F3), so identifier values arrive as parameters the call site binds to `enum` ops.\n\nTHE FOUR TTG-1 SHAPES (docs/evap-permeation.md \u00a72.6, crates/moves-calculators/src/generators/tank_temperature_generator.rs:1483-1537). `TankTemperatureGenerator` turns 24 hourly ambient temperatures into the parked vehicle's hourly tank temperature, and the step that does it is a RECURRENCE over a 96-cell quarter-hour axis. The arithmetic is split into four templates because three of the four are read by more than one equation and because the fourth is the guard the recurrence needs.\n\n`quarter_hour_interpolated_temperature` is TTG-1a: `t[h] + (ts - 1) * 0.25 * (t[next h] - t[h])`, a linear ramp from this hour's ambient temperature toward the next hour's. The `0.25` is written as the literal MOVES writes rather than as `1 / quarter_hours_per_hour`, because the two are the same number but not the same expression and the reference's own quarter-hour temperatures are stored at six significant figures; the association `((ts - 1) * 0.25) * delta` is the one the port evaluates (tank_temperature_generator.rs:1508).\n\n`quarter_hour_tank_temperature` is TTG-1b's smoothing: `1.4 * sumTempDelta + firstQHTankTemp`. The tank lags the air, and the 1.4 is the lag coefficient (`TANK_TEMP_SMOOTHING`). Two equations invoke it -- the recurrence's own body, which needs the tank temperature to form the delta it accumulates, and the equation that publishes the tank temperature -- so it is a template and not an inlined product. Writing it twice would be the classic way to end up with two different 1.4s.\n\n`quarter_hour_delta_sum` is the CARRIED VALUE of that recurrence: `sum + (quarterHourTemperature - quarterHourTankTemperature(sum))`. It invokes `quarter_hour_tank_temperature` (esm-spec \u00a79.7.3 layering) rather than repeating the smoothing, so the recurrence and its published output cannot drift apart. Note what it is NOT: it is not a prefix sum of independent terms, because each term is a function of the answer so far -- which is exactly why it needs esm-spec \u00a74.3.1.1's causal self-reference and not \u00a74.3.1's ordinary scan.\n\n`prior_quarter_hour_delta_sum` is the base-case guard, and it exists because \u00a74.3.1.1 point 6 says a self-read of an unpublished cell FAULTS: it does not read a zero ghost. So row 1's `sum` has to be written as a guard inside the body, `ifelse(k <= 1, 0, index(V, k - 1))`, and the guard is read by both equations above. Factoring it is not tidiness -- an `ifelse` in a recurrence body selects its branch BEFORE evaluating it (\u00a74.3.1.1), which is the property that keeps the guarded self-read from being evaluated at the first cell, and having one copy of it means there is one place where that property has to hold. What the guard must NOT be is a hard-coded first row: row 1's delta sum is `firstQHTankTemp` subtracted from the hour-1 quarter-hour temperature, which is computed, is zero only because those two are the same number, and would move if either input moved. A recurrence whose first cell is written as the literal 0.0 has one fewer input it can be perturbed through, and finding F24 is what perturbing a recurrence is for.\n\n`quarter_hours_per_hour` is the 4 of `timeStepID`. It is here rather than in lib/conversion.esm because it is not a property of the clock -- it is TTG's discretisation of it, and nothing outside the tank-temperature step knows about it. `hours_per_day` IS in lib/conversion.esm, for the mirror-image reason.\n\nADDED FOR docs/evap-fvv.md (process-evap-fvv).\n\n  * `cubic_in` -- docs/evap-fvv.md 2.13. The cubic a3*x^3 + a2*x^2 + a1*x + a0 that TVV-8 evaluates TWICE with different coefficients and different arguments: evapTemperatureAdjustment in max(T, 40), and the RVP-interpolated averageTankGasoline polynomial in T. Two call sites is why this is a template and TVV-3's exponential product (one call site) is not.\n\n  * `knot_interpolate` -- docs/evap-fvv.md 2.13, V30. Linear interpolation of one evapRVPTemperatureAdjustment term between the knots bracketing the fuel's own RVP. Four call sites, one per cubic term. The SQL brackets every RVP by first inserting sentinel knots at -1 and 1000 carrying the lowest and highest real knot's terms, so `high_knot - low_knot` is never zero.\n\n  * `tank_fuel_k_gasoline` -- docs/evap-fvv.md 2.5, TFG-1a. Called at a FORMULATION's ethanol volume in TFG-1a and again at the market-share AVERAGE ethanol volume in TFG-1d; the two are different numbers and that is the whole reason the average is taken before the k is evaluated rather than after.\n\n  * `tank_fuel_k_ethanol` -- docs/evap-fvv.md 2.5, TFG-1a. The 1000.0 arm is not a sentinel: at etoh_volume = 0 the ethanol term is k*0/100*2.3 = 0 whatever k is, so the branch exists only to keep 0^-0.8422 out of the expression.\n\n  * `tank_fuel_gas_portion_rvp` -- docs/evap-fvv.md 2.5, TFG-1a. Strips the ethanol's contribution off a formulation's RVP to leave the gasoline portion's. NULL RVP or NULL ETOHVolume makes this NULL in MOVES and the row is then skipped in the numerator but NOT in the denominator; coercing it to 0 was a recorded defect upstream (moves.rs AUDIT-canonical-fidelity.md:78).\n\n  * `tank_fuel_reddy_rvp` -- docs/evap-fvv.md 2.5, TFG-1e and TFG-3b. The inverse of tank_fuel_gas_portion_rvp: recombines a gasoline portion with the ethanol term. Called TWICE on the SAME etoh_volume with DIFFERENT gas portions -- unweathered at TFG-1e and weathered at TFG-3b -- and it is that shared ethanol term that makes TFG-3b's ratio of the two meaningful.\n\n  * `tank_fuel_zone_evap_temp` -- docs/evap-fvv.md 2.5, TFG-2a. The zone's single evaporative temperature from the month's ambient extremes. The guard arm is a plain midpoint, taken for a cold month or a flat one.\n\n  * `tank_fuel_rvp_loss_ratio` -- docs/evap-fvv.md 2.5, TFG-2c. The fraction of the gasoline portion's RVP weathered away. `max(0, .)` is the only clamp -- there is no upper one, and the denominator is not guarded against zero. On process-evap-fvv the unclamped value is -0.0589, so the clamp is what makes the answer exactly the formulation's own RVP; it is the one part of TFG this fixture checks.\n\n  * `tvv_quadratic_root` -- docs/evap-fvv.md 2.10, Form 1. The positive root of a*y^2 + b*y + c with b linear and c quadratic in the canister load Xn. MOVES stores this form three times over, once per coefficient set, inside cumTVVCoeffs.tvvEquation strings; here it is spelled ONCE and the three coefficient sets stay data. The max(0, .) inside the sqrt is moves.rs's clamp, where the SQL would yield NULL; process-evap-fvv never reaches a negative discriminant, so the two are indistinguishable on it (2.10, 8.1).\n\n  * `tvv_blend` -- docs/evap-fvv.md 2.10, Form 2. A convex blend of two tvv_quadratic_root evaluations, clamped at zero. T0, T1 and T2 are the degenerate weight = 1 case, so this ONE expression covers all six of MOVES's tvvEquation labels and the six coefficient rows are what distinguishes them.\n\n  * `tvv_leak_linear` -- docs/evap-fvv.md 2.10, Form 3. All TWELVE of MOVES's leakEquation labels are this one expression; L0..L11 differ only in the coefficient, which is data. Kept as a named template rather than inlined precisely to make that claim checkable in one place.\n\n  * `tvv_cumulative_vented` -- docs/evap-fvv.md 2.10, TVV-5. Blends the non-leaking and leaking-canister terms and weights by the regulatory-class fraction. Called twice per row, once with leakFraction and once with coalesce(leakFractionIM, leakFraction).",
    "authors": [
      "EarthSciML Authors and Contributors"
    ],
    "tags": [
      "moves",
      "onroad",
      "evaporative",
      "template-library"
    ]
  },
  "expression_templates": {
    "operating_share_of_activity": {
      "params": [
        "sho_total",
        "source_hours_total"
      ],
      "body": {
        "op": "ifelse",
        "args": [
          {
            "op": ">",
            "args": [
              "source_hours_total",
              0.0
            ]
          },
          {
            "op": "min",
            "args": [
              1.0,
              {
                "op": "/",
                "args": [
                  "sho_total",
                  "source_hours_total"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          0.0
        ]
      }
    },
    "soak_share": {
      "params": [
        "soak_activity_fraction",
        "operating_share"
      ],
      "body": {
        "op": "*",
        "args": [
          "soak_activity_fraction",
          {
            "op": "-",
            "args": [
              1.0,
              "operating_share"
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "quarter_hours_per_hour": {
      "params": [],
      "body": 4
    },
    "quarter_hour_interpolated_temperature": {
      "params": [
        "hour_temperature",
        "next_hour_temperature",
        "time_step"
      ],
      "body": {
        "op": "+",
        "args": [
          "hour_temperature",
          {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "-",
                "args": [
                  "time_step",
                  1
                ]
              },
              0.25,
              {
                "op": "-",
                "args": [
                  "next_hour_temperature",
                  "hour_temperature"
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "quarter_hour_tank_temperature": {
      "params": [
        "prior_delta_sum",
        "first_tank_temperature"
      ],
      "body": {
        "op": "+",
        "args": [
          {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              1.4,
              "prior_delta_sum"
            ]
          },
          "first_tank_temperature"
        ]
      }
    },
    "quarter_hour_delta_sum": {
      "params": [
        "prior_delta_sum",
        "quarter_hour_temperature",
        "first_tank_temperature"
      ],
      "body": {
        "op": "+",
        "args": [
          "prior_delta_sum",
          {
            "op": "-",
            "args": [
              "quarter_hour_temperature",
              {
                "op": "apply_expression_template",
                "args": [],
                "name": "quarter_hour_tank_temperature",
                "bindings": {
                  "prior_delta_sum": "prior_delta_sum",
                  "first_tank_temperature": "first_tank_temperature"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "prior_quarter_hour_delta_sum": {
      "params": [
        "previous_delta_sum",
        "quarter_hour_row"
      ],
      "body": {
        "op": "ifelse",
        "args": [
          {
            "op": "<=",
            "args": [
              "quarter_hour_row",
              1
            ]
          },
          0.0,
          "previous_delta_sum"
        ]
      }
    },
    "cubic_in": {
      "params": [
        "term3",
        "term2",
        "term1",
        "constant",
        "x"
      ],
      "body": {
        "op": "+",
        "args": [
          {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              "term3",
              {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  "x",
                  "x",
                  "x"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              "term2",
              {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  "x",
                  "x"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              "term1",
              "x"
            ]
          },
          "constant"
        ]
      }
    },
    "knot_interpolate": {
      "params": [
        "low_value",
        "high_value",
        "low_knot",
        "high_knot",
        "x"
      ],
      "body": {
        "op": "+",
        "args": [
          "low_value",
          {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "/",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "-",
                    "args": [
                      "high_value",
                      "low_value"
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "op": "-",
                    "args": [
                      "high_knot",
                      "low_knot"
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "op": "-",
                "args": [
                  "x",
                  "low_knot"
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "tank_fuel_k_gasoline": {
      "params": [
        "etoh_volume"
      ],
      "body": {
        "op": "+",
        "args": [
          {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              -7e-07,
              {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  "etoh_volume",
                  "etoh_volume",
                  "etoh_volume"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              0.0002,
              {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  "etoh_volume",
                  "etoh_volume"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              0.0024,
              "etoh_volume"
            ]
          },
          1.0
        ]
      }
    },
    "tank_fuel_k_ethanol": {
      "params": [
        "etoh_volume"
      ],
      "body": {
        "op": "ifelse",
        "args": [
          {
            "op": ">",
            "args": [
              "etoh_volume",
              0.0
            ]
          },
          {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              46.321,
              {
                "op": "^",
                "args": [
                  "etoh_volume",
                  -0.8422
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          1000.0
        ]
      }
    },
    "tank_fuel_gas_portion_rvp": {
      "params": [
        "rvp",
        "etoh_volume",
        "k_gasoline",
        "k_ethanol"
      ],
      "body": {
        "op": "/",
        "args": [
          {
            "op": "-",
            "args": [
              "rvp",
              {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  "k_ethanol",
                  {
                    "op": "/",
                    "args": [
                      "etoh_volume",
                      100.0
                    ]
                  },
                  2.3
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              "k_gasoline",
              {
                "op": "/",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "-",
                    "args": [
                      100.0,
                      "etoh_volume"
                    ]
                  },
                  100.0
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "tank_fuel_reddy_rvp": {
      "params": [
        "etoh_volume",
        "gas_portion_rvp",
        "k_gasoline",
        "k_ethanol"
      ],
      "body": {
        "op": "+",
        "args": [
          {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              "k_gasoline",
              {
                "op": "/",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "-",
                    "args": [
                      100.0,
                      "etoh_volume"
                    ]
                  },
                  100.0
                ]
              },
              "gas_portion_rvp"
            ]
          },
          {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              "k_ethanol",
              {
                "op": "/",
                "args": [
                  "etoh_volume",
                  100.0
                ]
              },
              2.3
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "tank_fuel_zone_evap_temp": {
      "params": [
        "min_temperature",
        "max_temperature"
      ],
      "body": {
        "op": "ifelse",
        "args": [
          {
            "op": "or",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "<",
                "args": [
                  "max_temperature",
                  40.0
                ]
              },
              {
                "op": "<=",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "-",
                    "args": [
                      "max_temperature",
                      "min_temperature"
                    ]
                  },
                  0.0
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "+",
                "args": [
                  "min_temperature",
                  "max_temperature"
                ]
              },
              2.0
            ]
          },
          {
            "op": "+",
            "args": [
              -1.7474,
              {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  1.029,
                  "min_temperature"
                ]
              },
              {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  0.99202,
                  {
                    "op": "-",
                    "args": [
                      "max_temperature",
                      "min_temperature"
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  -0.0025173,
                  "min_temperature",
                  {
                    "op": "-",
                    "args": [
                      "max_temperature",
                      "min_temperature"
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "tank_fuel_rvp_loss_ratio": {
      "params": [
        "zone_evap_temp",
        "gas_portion_rvp"
      ],
      "body": {
        "op": "max",
        "args": [
          0.0,
          {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "+",
                "args": [
                  -2.4908,
                  {
                    "op": "*",
                    "args": [
                      0.026196,
                      "zone_evap_temp"
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "op": "*",
                    "args": [
                      0.00076898,
                      "zone_evap_temp",
                      "gas_portion_rvp"
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "op": "+",
                "args": [
                  -0.086,
                  {
                    "op": "*",
                    "args": [
                      0.070592,
                      "gas_portion_rvp"
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "tvv_quadratic_root": {
      "params": [
        "canister_load",
        "a",
        "b1",
        "b0",
        "c2",
        "c1",
        "c0"
      ],
      "body": {
        "op": "/",
        "args": [
          {
            "op": "+",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "-",
                "args": [
                  0.0,
                  {
                    "op": "+",
                    "args": [
                      {
                        "op": "*",
                        "args": [
                          "b1",
                          "canister_load"
                        ]
                      },
                      "b0"
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "op": "sqrt",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "max",
                    "args": [
                      0.0,
                      {
                        "op": "-",
                        "args": [
                          {
                            "op": "*",
                            "args": [
                              {
                                "op": "+",
                                "args": [
                                  {
                                    "op": "*",
                                    "args": [
                                      "b1",
                                      "canister_load"
                                    ]
                                  },
                                  "b0"
                                ]
                              },
                              {
                                "op": "+",
                                "args": [
                                  {
                                    "op": "*",
                                    "args": [
                                      "b1",
                                      "canister_load"
                                    ]
                                  },
                                  "b0"
                                ]
                              }
                            ]
                          },
                          {
                            "op": "*",
                            "args": [
                              4.0,
                              "a",
                              {
                                "op": "+",
                                "args": [
                                  {
                                    "op": "*",
                                    "args": [
                                      "c2",
                                      {
                                        "op": "*",
                                        "args": [
                                          "canister_load",
                                          "canister_load"
                                        ]
                                      }
                                    ]
                                  },
                                  {
                                    "op": "*",
                                    "args": [
                                      "c1",
                                      "canister_load"
                                    ]
                                  },
                                  "c0"
                                ]
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              2.0,
              "a"
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "tvv_blend": {
      "params": [
        "inner_p",
        "inner_q",
        "weight"
      ],
      "body": {
        "op": "max",
        "args": [
          0.0,
          {
            "op": "+",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  "weight",
                  "inner_p"
                ]
              },
              {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "-",
                    "args": [
                      1.0,
                      "weight"
                    ]
                  },
                  "inner_q"
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "tvv_leak_linear": {
      "params": [
        "coefficient",
        "tvg_daily"
      ],
      "body": {
        "op": "*",
        "args": [
          "coefficient",
          "tvg_daily"
        ]
      }
    },
    "tvv_cumulative_vented": {
      "params": [
        "reg_class_fraction",
        "leak_fraction",
        "tvv_equation",
        "leak_equation"
      ],
      "body": {
        "op": "*",
        "args": [
          "reg_class_fraction",
          {
            "op": "max",
            "args": [
              0.0,
              {
                "op": "+",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "*",
                    "args": [
                      {
                        "op": "-",
                        "args": [
                          1.0,
                          "leak_fraction"
                        ]
                      },
                      "tvv_equation"
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "op": "*",
                    "args": [
                      "leak_fraction",
                      "leak_equation"
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
